    <string name="guide_step_1">1. Create a group, open it and tap “Add wallpaper” (multi-select or a whole folder).</string>
    <string name="guide_step_2">2. Set “Apply to” at the top of the group: Home / Lock screen / Both.</string>
    <string name="guide_step_3">3. Tapping a picture opens the system wallpaper screen; pick “Home screen” or “Home and lock screen” to apply.</string>
    <string name="guide_step_4">4. Automatic switching: Settings → “Switching” for timed / double-tap / unlock / floating button; lock screen only: “Lock screen switching”.</string>
